## Table Definitions

### CaseMaster

Primary table for all FIR/case records.

| Column | Type | Key | Description |
|--------|------|-----|-------------|
| CaseMasterID | INT | PK | Unique identifier for each FIR/case |
| CrimeNo | VARCHAR | | Crime Number: `1 digit Case Category + 4 digit District ID + 4 digit PS ID + 4 digit Year + 5 digit Serial` |
| CaseNo | VARCHAR | | Case Number: `YYYY + 5-digit serial` (last 9 digits from CrimeNo) |
| CrimeRegisteredDate | DATE | | Date when FIR was registered |
| PolicePersonID | INT | FK → Employee.EmployeeID | Officer who registered the FIR |
| PoliceStationID | INT | FK → Unit.UnitID | Police station where FIR is registered |
| CaseCategoryID | INT | FK → CaseCategory.CaseCategoryID | Category (FIR, UDR, PAR, Zero FIR) |
| GravityOffenceID | INT | FK → GravityOffence.GravityOffenceID | Gravity level (Heinous/Non-Heinous) |
| CrimeMajorHeadID | INT | FK → CrimeHead.CrimeHeadID | Major crime classification |
| CrimeMinorHeadID | INT | FK → CrimeSubHead.CrimeSubHeadID | Minor crime sub-classification |
| CaseStatusID | INT | FK → CaseStatusMaster.CaseStatusID | Current status |
| CourtID | INT | FK → Court.CourtID | Court where case is being heard |
| IncidentFromDate | DATETIME | | Start date/time of incident |
| IncidentToDate | DATETIME | | End date/time of incident |
| InfoReceivedPSDate | DATETIME | | When PS received information |
| latitude | DECIMAL | | GPS latitude coordinate |
| longitude | DECIMAL | | GPS longitude coordinate |
| BriefFacts | NVARCHAR(MAX) | | Summary of the case |

