## Relationship Matrix

### One-to-Many (Parent → Children)

| Parent Table | Child Table | Description |
|-------------|-------------|-------------|
| CaseMaster | Victim | One FIR → Multiple victims |
| CaseMaster | Accused | One FIR → Multiple accused |
| CaseMaster | ArrestSurrender | One FIR → Multiple arrest events |
| CaseMaster | ComplainantDetails | One FIR → Multiple complainants |
| CaseMaster | ActSectionAssociation | One FIR → Multiple act-sections |
| CaseMaster | ChargesheetDetails | One FIR → One chargesheet |
| CrimeHead | CrimeSubHead | One major → Multiple sub-heads |
| CrimeHead | CrimeHeadActSection | One head → Multiple act-sections |
| Act | Section | One act → Multiple sections |
| Act | CrimeHeadActSection | One act → Multiple crime heads |
| Court | CaseMaster | One court → Multiple cases |
| District | Court | One district → Multiple courts |
| District | Unit | One district → Multiple units |
| District | Employee | One district → Multiple employees |
| State | District | One state → Multiple districts |
| State | Unit | One state → Multiple units |
| Unit | Employee | One unit → Multiple employees |
| UnitType | Unit | One type → Multiple units |
| Rank | Employee | One rank → Multiple employees |
| Designation | Employee | One designation → Multiple employees |

### Many-to-One (Child → Parent)

| Child Table | Parent Table | Description |
|-------------|-------------|-------------|
| CaseMaster | CaseCategory | Many FIRs → Same category |
| CaseMaster | GravityOffence | Many FIRs → Same gravity |
| CaseMaster | CrimeHead | Many FIRs → Same major head |
| CaseMaster | CrimeSubHead | Many FIRs → Same sub-head |
| CaseMaster | CaseStatusMaster | Many FIRs → Same status |
| CaseMaster | Court | Many FIRs → Same court |
| CaseMaster | Employee | Many FIRs → Same registering officer |
| ArrestSurrender | State | Many arrests → Same state |
| ArrestSurrender | District | Many arrests → Same district |
| ArrestSurrender | Court | Many arrests → Same court |
| ArrestSurrender | Employee | Many arrests → Same IO |
| ComplainantDetails | OccupationMaster | Many complainants → Same occupation |
| ComplainantDetails | ReligionMaster | Many complainants → Same religion |
| ComplainantDetails | CasteMaster | Many complainants → Same caste |
| ActSectionAssociation | Act | Many associations → Same act |
| ActSectionAssociation | Section | Many associations → Same section |

---

